            <div xml:id="d526">

                <pb facs="0696" n="600" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg600"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">819.51/284: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Panama</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Price</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-27T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>4. Your 4, January 18, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department regrets inability of President and Fiscal Agent to agree on salary,
                    and will submit name of competent successor if <pb facs="0697" n="601"
                        xml:id="pg601"/> Ruan’s intention to leave Panama is in your opinion,
                    irrevocable. Refer to Department’s 51, December 7.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d526-f1"
                    /></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
